     2042           end.
     2043         end.
     2044       end.
     2045       if p-move-resize
     2046       then do:
     2047         run diasize_position-resize-button in this-procedure .
     2048       end.
     2049       if v-diasize-wndstore = true
     2050       then do:
     2051         if connected("ub") = true
